      "side": 1,
      "message": "256 sets x 8 ways \u003d 2048 entries, each holding a full filtered-layer bitmap, with no byte budget and no hook into SkGraphics::PurgeAllCaches / SkResourceCache memory pressure. A page doing full-viewport filtered drawImage calls with varying parameters can pin gigabytes that are never released. This needs a byte budget and a purge path (or should live in SkResourceCache, which already has both).",
      "revId": "d1831165aff28c8dbc7e6bccbf319869edb17863",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
