        "id": 3661524
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-05T16:29:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Process-global SkMutex taken on every qualifying saveLayer/restore. In Chrome this runs on all cc raster worker threads concurrently; a single lock here serializes them on exactly the pages that use filtered layers heavily. Needs at least per-set locking or a lock-free read path, and a measurement on a multi-tile raster workload.",
      "revId": "d1831165aff28c8dbc7e6bccbf319869edb17863",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
